# Plane QA

Load [`integration/plane/SKILL.md`](../../integration/plane/SKILL.md) and follow its cross-model hard gates

A bare Plane URL or ticket ID is a complete read request. Retest routes integration-plane → dynamic-web-exploratory RETEST_PLUS → integration-plane

State map: PASS → Done, FAILED → In Progress, BLOCKED → unchanged, new bug → Todo
